    basic: "In Football, a 'Natural' hand is almost never enough to win. You must aim for at least Four-of-a-Kind. If you don't start with a wild card (3 or 6) or a high pair, fold early.",
    intermediate: "Inventory Management: Because 2s give extra cards, having a 2 face-up is a huge advantage. It gives you a wider selection of cards to form your final 5ndcard hand, effectively increasing your 'draw' potential.",
